# Tests allowed to run longer than 10 s (scripts/test.sh).
#
# Empty on purpose: no test of this project needs more than 10 s. A line here is
# an exception the user agreed to, never a way to silence the warning.
#
# One test per line:  <full test name as nextest prints it> <max seconds> <why it cannot be faster>
# Example:  gear-engine merge::tests::some_test 15 real git over a slow fixture that cannot be shared
# A listed test still gets the warning when it runs past its own max.
